  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "[Version 0.3.0]\n\nIn this version, we upgrade the emitting engine to EmitToolbox 0.3.0,\nwhich provides better stability and helps us find bugs more easily.\n\nInjection entries, such as 'InjectionConstantEntry' are now public classes;\ncorresponding API to add and remove entries are also provided.\n\n'MemberInjector' has been reworked, and now developers can easily use 'InjectorOptions'\nto have a finer grained control over the injection behavior, \nsuch as what members to inject,\nand whether to record injected members and missing members.\nThis is useful for logging and debugging.\n\nWe also provide compatibility support for 'IServiceProvider' from 'Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection':\nfrom 'IInjectionProvider' to 'IServiceProvider' and from 'IServiceProvider' to 'IInjectionProvider'.",
  "repository": "",
